ng-6 text-slate-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-valkor-orange\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Incident detection and response workflow</span></div><div class=\"flex gap-3 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 p-4 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-valkor-orange\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Admin usefulness and trust feedback</span></div><div class=\"flex gap-3 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 p-4 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-valkor-orange\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>False alert rate</span></div><div class=\"flex gap-3 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 p-4 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-valkor-orange\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Missed detection rate</span></div><div class=\"flex gap-3 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 p-4 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-valkor-orange\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Low battery visibility</span></div><div class=\"flex gap-3 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 p-4 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-valkor-orange\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Stale data frequency</span></div><div class=\"flex gap-3 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 p-4 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-valkor-orange\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Attendance mismatch accuracy</span></div><div class=\"flex gap-3 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 p-4 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-valkor-orange\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Roll call completion accuracy</span></div></div><p class=\"mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-orange-200 bg-orange-50 p-5 text-sm font-semibold leading-6 text-slate-800\">Valkor is designed to start with a limited deployment, clear boundaries, and measurable outcomes. A pilot should prove reliability, usefulness, privacy comfort, and staff workflow value before any expansion.</p></section><section class=\"rounded-[2rem] bg-slate-950 p-6 text-white shadow-2xl shadow-slate-300/60 sm:p-8\"><div class=\"grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] lg:items-center\"><div><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em]\">Request a limited pilot review.</h2><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-6 text-slate-300\">Pilot reviews cover operational pain points, privacy and governance boundaries, infrastructure readiness, pilot scope, reliability expectations, success metrics, and end-of-pilot reporting.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row lg:justify-end\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold transition duration-300 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-orange-500/70 focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-white border border-orange-500/20 bg-orange-600 text-white shadow-lg shadow-orange-600/20 hover:bg-orange-700 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-orange-600/25 active:translate-y-px \" href=\"/#request-pilot\">Request Pilot Review<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold transition duration-300 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-orange-500/70 focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-white border border-white/15 bg-white/[0.08] text-white shadow-sm shadow-black/20 backdrop-blur hover:border-white/25 hover:bg-white/[0.14] active:translate-y-px \" href=\"mailto:jackson@valkorsystems.com?subject=Valkor%20Limited%20Pilot%20Review%20Request\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"16\" x=\"2\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7\"></path></svg>Email</a></div></div></section></div></div></main><footer class=\"border-t border-slate-200/80 bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,#ffffff_0%,#f8fafc_100%)] px-5 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-7xl flex-col gap-8 lg:flex-row lg:items-start lg:justify-between\"><div><img alt=\"Valkor Systems\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"170\" height=\"49\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-9 w-auto object-contain\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fvalkor-logo.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fvalkor-logo.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fvalkor-logo.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75\"/><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-md text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">School-controlled operational awareness for pass accountability, attendance reconciliation, incident workflow, staff response, confidence, and audit records.</p><p class=\"mt-2 max-w-md text-sm font-semibold leading-6 text-slate-700\">Currently accepting pilot applications - Virginia and East Coast schools.</p><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600\">Contact:<!-- --> <a class=\"font-medium text-slate-950 transition hover:text-valkor-orange\" href=\"mailto:jackson@valkorsystems.com\">jackson@valkorsystems.com</a></p></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-3 lg:justify-end\"><a class=\"text-sm font-medium text-slate-600 transition hover:text-